{
  "title": "Dysplasia Epiphysealis Hemimelica (Trevor's Disease)",
  "url": "https://www.orthobullets.com/pediatrics/4115/dysplasia-epiphysealis-hemimelica-trevors-disease",
  "subtitle": "Updated: Jun 22 2022",
  "sections": [
    {
      "text": "summary",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "3",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Dysplasia Epiphysealis Hemimelica, also known as Trevor's Disease, is a rare congenital bone dysplasia caused by the development of an osteochondroma in the epiphysis that presents with asymmetrical limb deformity.",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "5",
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "text": "Diagnosis is made with radiographs of the affected joint.",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "5",
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "text": "Treatment is usually surgical excision of the lesion in early symptomatic disease.",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "5",
          "children": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Epidemiology",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "3",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Incidence",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "extremely rare",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "estimated at ~ 1:1,000,000",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "3",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Demographics",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "recognised male predilection",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "usually presents in young children",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anatomic location",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "**most common in knee or ankle**",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "5",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "usually only involves one joint",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": []
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Etiology",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "3",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Pathophysiology",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "caused by a defect in the **Groove of Ranvier**",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "4",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "**asymmetrical limb deformity due to localized overgrowth of cartilage**",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "4",
              "children": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Genetic",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "**non hereditary**",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "4",
              "children": []
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Presentation",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "3",
      "children": [
